\ No longer compiles as-is post-P7.S7d: `.` is retired off the compiler and
\ onto `hosted::show`, so this file (and the P8 modules it dogfoods, which
\ don't exist yet) would also need `import: hosted::show | . | ;` and a
\ `depends: hosted` entry in this package's `sooth.pkg`, neither of which
\ exists here. Left un-migrated on purpose -- this is speculative P8
\ scaffolding, not a compiling program.
import: intrinsics * ;
import: core::text t | upper? | ;
import: collections::vec v ;

